    {
      "principle": "A husband who has stayed with his wife for a period of time, knowing about her previous marriage and divorce, may not be entitled to seek a declaration that his marriage is null and void.",
      "held": "The point which is required for the determination of the present appeal is whether a husband who has stayed with his wife for a period of 14 years having knowledge about the date of her divorce from earlier husband would be entitled to seek a declaration that his marriage is null and void",
